From e0cdd3338ff29979c03607f41c46ac7adcc21ad8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tonyfan <waterwet@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:21:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(telephony): recognize advanced NR signals

Normalize Motorola NR_CA registration and accept per-phone modem icon
hints without changing registration aggregation flags. Retain carrier
restrictions and clear hints on radio-off or loss of NR service.

Add registration and display-policy regression coverage.
